      <p>When systems fail, your ability to recover determines the impact on your business. MEAICON designs and implements disaster recovery and business continuity solutions with defined RTO and RPO targets, automated failover, and resilient backup architectures for organisations across the the GCC, Africa, South Asia, and North America.</p>
