        <div class="prose-content">
          <p>MEAICON's disaster recovery practice is built on the principle that resilience must be engineered and tested, not assumed. We begin by understanding your business requirements — how quickly each system must recover (RTO) and how much data loss is tolerable (RPO) — and design recovery architectures that meet those targets within your budget.</p>
          <p>Our solutions span backup and restore, replication to secondary sites, cloud-based failover, and full business continuity planning. We do not stop at designing recovery — we test it regularly, document runbooks, and ensure your team knows exactly what to do when a real disruption occurs. From hardware failure to site-wide outage, we build recovery capability that works when it matters most.</p>
